          deckDescription: 'A 27-card pack made from a standard French deck by selecting a fixed set of cards: the four Sevens (Bísefarnir), all Aces, all Jacks, all 6s, the 8s except 8 of spades, plus Q of clubs, 2 of spades, K of diamonds, 2 of hearts, 4 of clubs, 8 of spades, 9 of hearts, and 9 of diamonds. Used only for the Icelandic game Treikort.',
